  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">지금 제가 있는 학교는 전체적으로 학업성취도가 아주 낮은 학교라 아래글처럼 어려운 책은 이용하기가 어려워요~ 저희학교처럼 흥미도 많이 잃은 아이들을 위해 동화책을 소개합니다.<br>오늘 제 아이랑 도서관에 갔다가 발견했네요^^<br><br><br>진화단원에서 상아없는 코끼리가 태어나는 인위적 자연선택? 이야기 해줄때 .<br>인간과 코끼리의 입장을 바꾼 이야기입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ed6243e3dfde18754ccefc54ed9b36a89a22fab0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ed6243e3dfde18754ccefc54ed9b36a89a22fab0\" data-origin-width=\"2369\" data-origin-height=\"2895\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>플라스틱</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2363cf4e9bb389a3903076fb8617f46841a3ce40\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2363cf4e9bb389a3903076fb8617f46841a3ce40\" data-origin-width=\"1587\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">로드킬<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e5c36552e18fc905f59e084173bb58da9e9fac5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e5c36552e18fc905f59e084173bb58da9e9fac5\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1617\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f292cf541d6905b550ff4cd53cb6aa4554d87e9d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f292cf541d6905b550ff4cd53cb6aa4554d87e9d\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1802\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">쓰레기<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6e8610f9fa0f2c8b8922bc0233a53f64ccf9d0e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b6e8610f9fa0f2c8b8922bc0233a53f64ccf9d0e\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1614\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/634851d054affdcdf85e827df3ec1313de2f9fe4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/634851d054affdcdf85e827df3ec1313de2f9fe4\" data-origin-width=\"1768\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">원자력발전</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6d9a449d3881e0bef8168e962182c98e6e2a5341\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6d9a449d3881e0bef8168e962182c98e6e2a5341\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1586\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
